          nada chega à imprensa sem revisão jurídica.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TIMELINE — ritmo do processo -->
    <section class="relative z-20 bg-[var(--secondary)] border-t border-[var(--hairline)]">
      <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 sec-pad">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-8 mb-12 reveal">
